---

Attribution. Ideas in this package, not their code or text, come from public agent workflows,
credited in docs/05-decisions.md. Among them:

- pstack (a public agent plugin): a coordinator that never writes code, a verdict valid for one
  exact commit, a retry table by failure type, a pull-request state machine and a plan linter;
- ECC (a public agent plugin): small hooks that block a tool call, a shell-parsing guard for
  dangerous version-control commands, secret and hidden-Unicode scans, and hook hygiene.

No text or code from either is included here.
